{"id":"ebf90bb8e698a16a","group":"56","path":"56/56-lem-redex-pattern-static-transport.md","title":"红项模式追踪与具体残余的一致性","display":"lem-redex-pattern-static-transport — 红项模式追踪与具体残余的一致性","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-lem-redex-pattern-static-transport","aliases":["56-lem-redex-pattern-static-transport"],"display":"lem-redex-pattern-static-transport — 红项模式追踪与具体残余的一致性","depends_on":["[[56-df-trace-ancestors]]","[[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]"],"source_section":"§8.6.2 Definition 8.6.27; §9.2 Proposition 9.2.2 and Lemma 9.2.8","source_printed_pages":"398,485,488","source_statement_status":"source-residual-trace-correspondence-compared; concrete-path-specialization-local","source_proof_status":"local-induction-on-labelled-reduction; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-lem-redex-pattern-static-transport"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-lem-redex-pattern-static-transport</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-redex-pattern-static-transport — 红项模式追踪与具体残余的一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c39af7178b60264b\" href=\"?note=c39af7178b60264b\" title=\"56-df-trace-ancestors\">56-df-trace-ancestors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fec2299959a8e3bb\" href=\"?note=fec2299959a8e3bb\" title=\"56-df-reduction-residual-transport\">56-df-reduction-residual-transport</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.6.2 Definition 8.6.27; §9.2 Proposition 9.2.2 and Lemma 9.2.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"398,485,488"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-residual-trace-correspondence-compared; concrete-path-specialization-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-induction-on-labelled-reduction; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c39af7178b60264b\" href=\"?note=c39af7178b60264b\" title=\"56-df-trace-ancestors\">56-df-trace-ancestors</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tr}_R^m,\\operatorname{RPat}_R,\\operatorname{wit}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Tr}_R^m,\\operatorname{RPat}_R,\\operatorname{wit}_R\\)</span>；采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fec2299959a8e3bb\" href=\"?note=fec2299959a8e3bb\" title=\"56-df-reduction-residual-transport\">56-df-reduction-residual-transport</a> 的正交系统及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_R\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)\">\\(s=\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)\">\\(t=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\">\\(u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_u=\\operatorname{RPat}_R((s,u,\\operatorname{ctr}_R(s,u)))\">\\(P_u=\\operatorname{RPat}_R((s,u,\\operatorname{ctr}_R(s,u)))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为任意位置关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 为其源位置集的子集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Im}_A(P)\\coloneqq\\{w\\mid\\exists z\\in P\\;(z,w)\\in A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Im}_A(P)\\coloneqq\\{w\\mid\\exists z\\in P\\;(z,w)\\in A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hit}_R(\\rho,u)\\iff\n\\exists i&lt;\\ell(\\rho)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{step}_i(\\rho)\\in\nT\\times\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho|_i,u)\\times T\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Hit}_R(\\rho,u)\\iff\n\\exists i&lt;\\ell(\\rho)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{step}_i(\\rho)\\in\nT\\times\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho|_i,u)\\times T\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Im}_{\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho))}(P_u)\n=\\bigcup_{v\\in\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,u)}\n\\operatorname{RPat}_R((t,v,\\operatorname{ctr}_R(t,v))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Im}_{\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho))}(P_u)\n=\\bigcup_{v\\in\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,u)}\n\\operatorname{RPat}_R((t,v,\\operatorname{ctr}_R(t,v))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\operatorname{Hit}_R(\\rho,u)\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Im}_{\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho))}(P_u)\n=\\operatorname{Im}_{\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho))}(P_u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\operatorname{Hit}_R(\\rho,u)\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Im}_{\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho))}(P_u)\n=\\operatorname{Im}_{\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho))}(P_u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\neg\\operatorname{Hit}_R(\\rho,u)\\land\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,u)=\\varnothing\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Im}_{\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho))}(P_u)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\neg\\operatorname{Hit}_R(\\rho,u)\\land\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,u)=\\varnothing\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Im}_{\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho))}(P_u)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一步case与本目录残余定义逐项对应。收缩本身的模式没有静态后裔；位置不交或所追踪红项在上方时，模式保持原坐标；所追踪红项在收缩的变量实例中时，其顶点和内部边按该变量的所有右出现复制，变量被删除则像为空。正交性排除了一个红项根落在另一个左项非变量模式中的其它情况。模式没有根入边，因此collapsing时根边的静态合并不会在模式像中产生多余位置。</p>\n<p>每个尚未被收缩的残余模式与当前收缩模式不交；动态关系区别于静态关系的新增对仅从当前收缩模式出发。因此，在Hit尚未出现的每一步上，这些残余模式的动态像与静态像相同。把一步等式按关系复合与集合并归纳，即得有限路径结论；若末端残余为空，则其动态模式像也为空。这给needed-trace一致性逆向证明提供正式的“全部被删除则无trace”桥，不能仅凭最终残余为空忽略Hit条件。</p>\n<p>来源为本地Terese DjVu：第398页把模式的静态追踪称为残余；第485页区分删除消除与重叠消除；第488页在needed-trace逆向中使用这一分类。本原子在既有正交具体步编码中给出该桥的归纳推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-trace-ancestors","status":"resolved","id":"c39af7178b60264b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-trace-ancestors]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-residual-transport","status":"resolved","id":"fec2299959a8e3bb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-trace-ancestors","status":"resolved","id":"c39af7178b60264b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-trace-ancestors]] 的 $\\operatorname{Tr}_R^m,\\operatorname{RPat}_R,\\operatorname{wit}_R$；采用 [[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]] 的正交系统及 $\\operatorname{Res}_R$。$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$s=\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)$，$t=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)$，$u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$。$P_u=\\operatorname{RPat}_R((s,u,\\operatorname{ctr}_R(s,u)))$；$A$ 为任意位置关系，$P$ 为其源位置集的子集。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-residual-transport","status":"resolved","id":"fec2299959a8e3bb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-trace-ancestors]] 的 $\\operatorname{Tr}_R^m,\\operatorname{RPat}_R,\\operatorname{wit}_R$；采用 [[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]] 的正交系统及 $\\operatorname{Res}_R$。$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$s=\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)$，$t=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)$，$u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$。$P_u=\\operatorname{RPat}_R((s,u,\\operatorname{ctr}_R(s,u)))$；$A$ 为任意位置关系，$P$ 为其源位置集的子集。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tr}_R^m,\\operatorname{RPat}_R,\\operatorname{wit}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Res}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R","display":false},{"tex":"s=\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"t=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)","display":false},{"tex":"P_u=\\operatorname{RPat}_R((s,u,\\operatorname{ctr}_R(s,u)))","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Im}_A(P)\\coloneqq\\{w\\mid\\exists z\\in P\\;(z,w)\\in A\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hit}_R(\\rho,u)\\iff\n\\exists i<\\ell(\\rho)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{step}_i(\\rho)\\in\nT\\times\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho|_i,u)\\times T\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Im}_{\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho))}(P_u)\n=\\bigcup_{v\\in\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,u)}\n\\operatorname{RPat}_R((t,v,\\operatorname{ctr}_R(t,v))).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\operatorname{Hit}_R(\\rho,u)\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Im}_{\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho))}(P_u)\n=\\operatorname{Im}_{\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho))}(P_u).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\neg\\operatorname{Hit}_R(\\rho,u)\\land\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,u)=\\varnothing\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Im}_{\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho))}(P_u)=\\varnothing.","display":true}],"bytes":3356,"backlinks":[{"id":"475d1dab5264244e","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"固定正交系统。$\\Pi\\in\\mathcal P_R$ 满足 $\\operatorname{CleanNF}_R(\\Pi)$；$s=S(\\Pi)$，$z=T(\\Pi)$，$P=\\operatorname{TPos}(z)$。$a=(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R$。$\\nu_{SR},A_R,\\operatorname{PWit}_R$ 见 [[56-df-needed-sr-measure]]，提取、Rpc、nonneeded保持见 [[56-lem-needed-reduction-extraction]]、[[56-lem-needed-prefix-rpc]]、[[56-lem-nonneeded-preserves-needed-prefix]]；指定残余图及良基测度见 [[56-thm-complete-development-diamond]]、[[56-lem-residual-parallel-moves]]、[[56-lem-sr-measure-well-founded]]；模式的静态残余传送与无收缩命中时的动态传送见 [[56-lem-redex-pattern-static-transport]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-lem-redex-pattern-static-transport.md]]"},{"id":"b27fe8e1fab5f371","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[56-df-needed-redex]] 的正交系统，$s\\in T$、$u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$；$\\operatorname{Needed}_R$ 见该节点。$\\operatorname{TraceNeeded}_R(s,u)$、$\\operatorname{TN}_R$、$\\operatorname{Anc}_R$ 见 [[56-df-trace-ancestors]]。有限标准化存在性、标准步对最终项的trace与trace的置换不变性分别见 [[56-thm-finite-standardization]]、[[56-lem-standard-steps-trace-target]]、[[56-lem-trace-permutation]]；模式残余传送及消除分类见 [[56-lem-redex-pattern-static-transport]]。"}],"outgoing":["c39af7178b60264b","fec2299959a8e3bb"]}